Error [E0113]: This value is String (text), but `answer` returns Int
  --> tests/ui/return_type_mismatch.jet:1:22
    |
  1 | fn answer() -> Int { "forty-two" }
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `answer` declares Int as its result, so the value it hands back must be Int
 Fix: Hand back a Int value: convert this value to Int, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
